## Configuration

`config.json` example:

```json
{
  "llm_providers": {
    "deepseek": {
      "api_key": "sk-...",
      "model": "deepseek-v4-pro",
      "base_url": "https://api.deepseek.com",
      "default": true,
      "temperature": 0.3,
      "max_tokens": 4096
    },
    "claude": {
      "api_key": "sk-ant-...",
      "model": "claude-sonnet-4-6",
      "default": false
    }
  },
  "extraction": {
    "provider": "deepseek",
    "max_modules_per_extraction": 10
  },
  "cache": {
    "enabled": true,
    "max_modules": 50
  }
}
```

`config.json` is gitignored — never commit API keys.

